        "lineStart": 657,
        "lineEnd": 657
      },
      "rulesText": "Battle Cry: Commit Effort for the day as an On Turn action to bolster your allies. They gain +1 to hit, saving throws, and damage, including Shock, for one round per level. At 4th level this bonus increases to +2, and at 9th, to +3.",
      "tradition": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/wwn-system-json/objects/classes/bard"
