        "lineStart": 1404,
        "lineEnd": 1404
      },
      "rulesText": "Inexorable Effect: Commit Effort for the day as an Instant action to force an enemy to re-roll a successful saving throw and take the worse result. You may use this art only once per scene.",
      "tradition": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/wwn-system-json/objects/classes/high-mage"
      },
