      },
      "traditionName": "high-magic",
      "level": 4,
      "effects": [
        {
          "sourceText": "The caster sets up a triggered resonance of dispelling magic which may later be invoked as an Instant action. Until the next dawn, the mage may negate magic as if with an **_Extirpate Arcana_** spell as an Instant action. Once this negation is triggered, the spell ends."
